{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thank you for joining this planning roundtable. As you know, the middle school has proposed a six-week peer-tutoring program for students in grades 6 through 8, and I've called us together to gather relevant information before I sign off on the approval. The draft plan currently calls for two adult supervisors, Google Classroom for session communication, student-selected tutor pairings, and paper consent forms collected before the program begins. I'd like to go around the table and hear from each of you regarding your area of expertise. Let's start with the teacher — could you share your perspective on the proposed student-selected tutor pairings and any academic considerations we should be aware of?"}
```

