{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF3", "text": "Dr. Singh, I need to flag a technology concern with the draft plan. Google Classroom is not approved for this program's student-to-student communication. The district-managed Microsoft Teams education environment is the approved platform and retains the required school records. I confirmed the platform settings with district IT this week, but the technology field in the draft application has not been updated to reflect this. Before approval is finalized, the draft plan needs to be revised to specify Microsoft Teams instead of Google Classroom."}
```

